{"speciesId":269,"names":{"fr":"Papinox","es":"Dustox","en":"Dustox","ja":"ドクケイル"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"DUSTOX is instinctively drawn to light. Swarms of this POKéMON are attracted by the bright lights of cities, where they wreak havoc by stripping the leaves off roadside trees for food."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"When DUSTOX flaps its wings, a fine dust is scattered all over. This dust is actually a powerful poison that will even make a pro wrestler sick. This POKéMON searches for food using its antennae like radar."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"It is a nocturnal POKéMON that flies from fields and mountains to the attraction of streetlights at night. It looses highly toxic powder from its wings."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It scatters horribly toxic dust when it senses danger. They tend to gather in the glow of streetlamps at night."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It scatters horribly toxic dust when it senses danger. They tend to gather in the glow of streetlamps at night."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"A nocturnal Pokémon. Drawn by streetlights, they messily eat the leaves of trees lining boulevards."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It violently flutters its wings to scatter toxic dust when attacked. It becomes active after sunset."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"Toxic powder is scattered with each flap. At night, it is known to strip leaves off trees lining boulevards."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It scatters its fine dust all over when it is attacked. It is a nocturnal Pokémon."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It scatters its fine dust all over when it is attacked. It is a nocturnal Pokémon."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il disperse un nuage de poudre toxique à chaque coup d’aile. Il aime les feuilles d’arbres urbains."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Toxic powder is scattered with each flap. At night, it is known to strip leaves off trees lining boulevards."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il disperse un nuage de poudre toxique à chaque coup d’aile. Il aime les feuilles d’arbres urbains."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Toxic powder is scattered with each flap. At night, it is known to strip leaves off trees lining boulevards."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Toxic powder is scattered with each flap. At night, it is known to strip leaves off trees lining boulevards."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Toxic powder is scattered with each flap. At night, it is known to strip leaves off trees lining boulevards."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Ce Pokémon nocturne est attiré par les lueurs de la ville et aime les feuilles des arbres urbains."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Pokémon nocturno. Atraído por las luces de la ciudad, se come las hojas y arbustos de las avenidas."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"A nocturnal Pokémon. Drawn by streetlights, they messily eat the leaves of trees lining boulevards."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"夜行性の ポケモン。 明かりに 誘われた ドクケイルが 街路樹の 葉を 食い散らかす。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Quand on l’attaque, il bat des ailes pour répandre sa poudre toxique. Il sort après le coucher du soleil."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Cuando se le ataca, bate las alas con fuerza para esparcir polvo tóxico. Es un Pokémon nocturno."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It violently flutters its wings to scatter toxic dust when attacked. It becomes active after sunset."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"襲われると 激しく 羽ばたいて 猛毒の 粉を まき散らす。 日が暮れると 行動を はじめる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Papinox est instinctivement attiré par la lumière. Des nuées de ce Pokémon sont attirées par les réverbères des villes, où il sème la pagaille en grignotant les feuilles des arbres en bordure de route."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Los Dustox se acercan a la luz de forma instintiva. De hecho, se agrupan en enjambres alrededor de las luces de las ciudades y causan estragos en las hojas de los árboles que están a pie de calle para alimentarse."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Dustox is instinctively drawn to light. Swarms of this Pokémon are attracted by the bright lights of cities, where they wreak havoc by stripping the leaves off roadside trees for food."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"灯りに 引き寄せられる 習性を 持つ。 街灯りに 誘われた ドクケイルの 群れが 街路樹の 葉っぱを 食べ散らかしてしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Lorsque Papinox bat des ailes, une légère poussière se répand. Cette poussière est en fait un puissant poison capable de mettre au tapis un boxeur professionnel. Ce Pokémon cherche sa nourriture avec ses antennes, comme un radar."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Cuando Dustox bate las alas, libera un polvillo fino que en realidad es un peligroso veneno que puede resultar dañino hasta al más fuerte de los fuertes. Las antenas le sirven de radar para buscar comida."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"When Dustox flaps its wings, a fine dust is scattered all over. This dust is actually a powerful poison that will even make a pro wrestler sick. This Pokémon searches for food using its antennae like radar."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"羽ばたくと 細かい 粉が 舞い上がる。 吸いこむと プロレスラーも 寝込む 猛毒だ。 触角の レーダーで エサを 探す。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"Tends to be drawn to bonfires on dark nights. Difficult to chase away from settlements because of the way it scatters highly toxic scales."}],"varieties":[{"id":269,"moves":[{"name":"gust","learns":[[5,"level-up",13],[6,"level-up",13],[7,"level-up",13],[8,"level-up",13],[9,"level-up",13],[10,"level-up",13],[11,"level-up",13],[12,"level-up",13],[13,"level-up",13],[14,"level-up",13],[15,"level-up",13],[16,"level-u